WEBVTT

00:00:00.012 --> 00:00:07.632
While loops are especially useful when the stopping point depends on a changing value rather than a known number of

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:15.547
items. In the first example, balance starts at one hundred and decreases by twenty until it reaches zero.

00:00:15.547 --> 00:00:21.862
In the second, visits begins at one and doubles until it is no longer below eight.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:30.172
A useful rule of thumb is: use for when the items are known; use while when the stopping condition depends on how a

00:00:30.172 --> 00:00:32.801
value changes over time.
